---
permalink: "/countries/"
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Направления - EvolveClub"
description: "Опубликованные направления EvolveClub."
bodyClass: "country-page"
---

{% set countries = collections.country | whereTruthy("data.published") | sortByOrder %}

<main id="top">
  <section class="country-hotels">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">EvolveClub</p>
        <h2>Направления</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-lead">Все опубликованные направления, доступные для подбора путешествия.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hotel-grid">
      {% for country in countries %}
        <a class="hotel-card hotel-card-link" href="/countries/{{ country.data.slug }}/">
          <div class="hotel-card-image" style="background-image: url('{{ country.data.cover }}');"></div>
          <div class="hotel-card-body">
            <span>{{ country.data.region }}</span>
            <h3>{{ country.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ country.data.subtitle }}</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
